#1112
thain~
the Thain~
The Thain commands respect from all Shire folk.~
A personable yet serious halfling, the Thain looks at you and yells a
deep 'Hullo'.  He walks about comfortably, secure in the knowledge that
as long as he's in office, the Shire will always remain a safe haven for
Shire folk.~
ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_RACE|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
0 
400 S
30 0 0 1d1+479 1d1+21
500 RACE_HALFLING
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 1
  if quest(0, 2, $n) == 0
    say Greetings, $n!
    say You may or may not know that we have been troubled
    say by ogres of late.  Please say that you will do us a service?
  endif
else
  if race($n) == 7
    if actorhasobjnum(2850)
      say Die ogre swine!
      mpkill $n
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>give_prog i2861~
if quest(0, 2, $n) == 1
  mpoload 1117
  say Your help has been very welcome, $n.
  say Take this in thanks.
  give i1117 $n
  drop i1117
  mpjunk all
  mpmset $n quest 0 2 2
endif
~
>speech_prog yes sure yep ok~
if race($n) == 1
  if quest(0, 2, $n) == 0
    say Please kill the ogre chieftan for us.
    say We suspect this will end their threat.
    say Come back with proof and I will reward you well.
    mpoload 1116
    give i1116 $n
    drop i1116
    mpjunk all
    mpmset $n quest 0 2 1
  endif
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum (2850)
  shout Beware!  $n is an agent of the ogres!
  mpmset $n quest 2 2 1
  mpoload 1115
endif
~
|
